(7522064, 1201503, 97225, '<td valign="top">I love your hydrant boy, Lydia. And your notes crack me up. I''m sure if you''d taken your dog to the hydrant he''d have peed on it. Even if just to be the first...but he wouldn''t be. I guarantee that you''d have won ... so... I''m lucky you didn''t take your dog to that hydrant. Or any hydrant.</td>', 'I love your hydrant boy, Lydia. And your notes crack me up. I''m sure if you''d taken your dog to the hydrant he''d have peed on it. Even if just to be the first...but he wouldn''t be. I guarantee that you''d have won ... so... I''m lucky you didn''t take your dog to that hydrant. Or any hydrant.', '2017-07-08 04:40:40.000000', NULL, 0),
